+/**
+ * Subscription billing on Razorpay.
+ *
+ * The rule this module exists to enforce: a subscription's status, period and
+ * payments are written ONLY while handling a signature-verified Razorpay
+ * webhook. Nothing a browser sends can activate a subscription, set an amount,
+ * or record a payment.
+ *
+ *   startSubscription    creates the Razorpay subscription and a local row in
+ *                        "pending". Pending grants no access.
+ *   confirmCheckout      checks the signature Checkout hands the browser. It
+ *                        tells the UI the payment was genuinely submitted; it
+ *                        writes nothing.
+ *   handleWebhook        the only writer of subscription state and payments.
+ *                        Idempotent per provider event id.
+ *   requestCancellation  asks Razorpay to cancel and records the request. The
+ *                        status change itself arrives by webhook.
